<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόττᾰβ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ion.
		and older 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσσᾰβος</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			179.4
		</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			631
		</span></i> (pl.)), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
			cottabos</i>, a Sicilian game (<i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				2.1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>), of throwing heel-taps into a metal basin, described by
				<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.665d
			</span></i> sqq., Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				342
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτταβίζειν</span>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.</span> is found in various
			senses, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>the game itself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
			</span></i> l.c., Critiasl.c., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				69.4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the prize</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτταβεῖον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.667d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>the wine thrown</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάταξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				55.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>the basin</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτταβεῖον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				55.12
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότταβος ἀσπίδων</span> is
			prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόναβος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				3.210S.
			</span></i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
